PROJECT OVERVIEW
The student Grade Management System stores/enters the names of students and their grades,
calculating the average grades of students,determining the lowest grads and the highest
grades for students across the various subject.This system also shows a brief summary of
the the students grades/marks in every subject.All of this was done by breaking the code 
down into functions for better organization and maintainability by creating functions,
implementing the search and update functions and error handling.

SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
Before coding the programing I installed pycharm onto my pc.I used pycharm to code
Section D.I coded my program and run it,after coding all results will be displayed
on the console wher i entered  the subjects of the students,updating the students,
viewed and searched for the student names and records.I did all this to ensure 
that the program was returning the expected outputs.

FEATURES LIST
-entering the student names
-entering the student grades
-entering the student subjects(math,science and english)
-calculating the average for every single student
-calculating the overall average  of all students
-calculating the lowest and highest
-showing a summary table showing the grades of all student
-showing an error message when the the user enters a value that is not correct/invalid

CLASS ARCHITECTURE
1.The user enters the names,grades and subjects
2.Calculating the average of eachs tudent and the overall average of all students
3.Calculating the lowest grades
4.calculating the highest grades
5.Showing the student summary
6.Updating students
7.Searching students
8.viewing students


EXAMPLE INPUT AND OUTPUT:
Enter name of student 1: Larona
Enter number of students:2
Enter English grade: 70
Enter Math grade: 75
Enter Science grade: 80

Enter name of student 2: Leatile
Enter English grade: 80
Enter Math grade:85
Enter Science grade:90

output:
Name     Average
Larona   81.88
Leatile  71.45

Class Total:106.82
Class Average:82.80

TESTING SUMMARY
-when a student enters a number instead of a name,an error message will be shown
-when astudent enters a string instead of a numeric value,an error message will be shown
-when updating the student the output should be updated succesfully
-when searching hte students,it should show the student grades and results

KNOWN ISSUES
-the names of the students are case-sensitive
